    "notes": [
      "Demonstrates: long aluminium sub-main (125 m buried, NA2XY 4x35) sized for voltage drop (du_pct, installation du_max_pct), barn board on its own sheet with a type S 300 mA RCD, selective with the 30 mA RCDs downstream and the 1 A 0.5 s RCD upstream, agricultural loads (vacuum pump, milk cooling, frost-protected troughs), separate barn earth electrode (TT)",
      "Voltage drop at Ib = 48 A, cos φ 0.85: 1.9 % on the sub-main, 2.4 % total at the barn board (limit 5 % for other uses)",
      "Agricultural premises (IEC 60364-7-705): 30 mA on all socket circuits ≤ 32 A, 300 mA fire protection on the whole barn"
    ]
